---
pagination:
  data: i18n.seriesItems
  size: 1
  alias: s
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "/reihen/{{ s.slug }}/index.html"
layout: editorial-base.njk
lang: de
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ s.label.de }} · Reihe {{ s.colorName.de }} · AETERNUS Verlag"
  description: "{{ s.desc.de }}"
---
<main id="main"><section class="series-intro{% if s.slug == 'rot' or s.slug == 'anthrazit' %} series-intro-portrait{% endif %}"><div class="shell"><p class="kicker light-kicker">Reihe {{ s.num }} · {{ s.colorName.de }}</p><h1>{{ s.label.de }}</h1><p>{{ s.desc.de }}</p><a href="/reihen/" class="quiet-link">Alle sieben Reihen →</a></div>{% if s.mood.file %}<img src="/assets/images/{{ s.mood.file }}.webp" alt="" width="1600" height="900" fetchpriority="high">{% endif %}</section>{% if s.slug == 'gruen' %}{% include 'history-teaser.njk' %}{% endif %}<section class="shell paper-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="kicker">Das Programm der Reihe</p><h2>Werke entdecken.</h2></div></div><div class="books-grid">{% set count = 0 %}{% for item in catalogue.books %}{% if item.series == s.slug %}{% include 'book-card.njk' %}{% set count = count + 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% if count == 0 %}<div class="empty-series"><p>Das Programm dieser Reihe wächst. Hier finden Sie künftig die einzelnen Ausgaben.</p><a class="text-link" href="/buecher/">In anderen Reihen stöbern →</a></div>{% endif %}
{% if s.authors.length %}<div class="series-authors"><p class="kicker">Autoren dieser Reihe</p>{% for author in s.authors %}<a href="{{ author.landingUrl.de }}">{{ author.name }} ↗</a>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
{% if s.slug == 'bernstein' %}<a class="text-link" href="/bernstein-maerchen/">Märchen und Sagen entdecken →</a>{% endif %}</section></main>
